cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PyCLM in your research, please cite the paper below
  (preferred-citation). To record the exact software version, also cite the
  release you used.
title: "PyCLM: closed-loop optogenetic microscopy in Python"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Oatman
    given-names: Harrison R.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2699-6374"
  - family-names: Gubbens
